79 | orchards | Codori farm orchard (replanted) | bld-codori-farm | 2006 replanting (modern) | stated | The Codori farm orchard was replanted in apples in 2006 | It was replanted in apples in 2006. | The Codori Farm Orchard is bounded
79 | orchards | Battle-significant characteristics of orchards | - | 1863-07 (general) | stated | The battle-significant characteristics of the orchards included their limits or boundaries, the age or size of the tree, and the planting pattern | The battle-significant characteristics included their limits or boundaries, >>> and the planting pattern. ~#1
79 | fields | Jacob Culp field (outlot) | - | 1863-07 | stated | The Jacob Culp field was an open outlot of a town resident on the east slope of Seminary Ridge next to Long Lane | This individual field was an outlot for a town resident. >>> throughout the majority of the battle. | #s15
