81 | orchards | Rogers orchard (replanted) | bld-rogers-house | 2006 replanting (modern) | stated | The Rogers orchard was planted in apples in 2006 | It was planted in apples in 2006. | (NR 2004, Sec.7: 62) Rogers Orchard.
82 | fields | S. R. Russell corn field (outlot on the east slope of Seminary Ridge) | - | 1863-07 | stated | The Russell field was planted in corn at the time of the battle and the crop was still immature | Planted in corn at the time of the battle, the immature crop >>> prolonged occupation of the field. | #s1
82 | fences | S. R. Russell field and Long Lane | - | 1863-07 | stated | The Russell field was a fence-enclosed outlot and Long Lane, which abutted its southeastern edge, was fence-enclosed | Access from the town was by way of Long Lane, which was fence-enclosed and abutted the southeastern edge of the field. | #s4
