84 | woodlots | Shultz Woods | - | 1863-07 | stated | The oak woods of Shultz Woods early gave to this part of Gettysburg's town suburbs the name Oak Ridge | These oak woods early gave to this part of Gettysburg’s town suburbs the name Oak Ridge. | #s18
